{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/StoreGif2.gif?t=1743210116\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into Cultivation Story: Infinite Sword Realm, a roguelike deckbuilder where every decision impacts your journey. Build a powerful deck from a variety of unique cards, collect relics, and unlock special perks that can shift the odds in your favor. Explore branching paths filled with challenging enemies, random encounters, and valuable treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/StoreGif1.gif?t=1743210116\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run brings fresh challenges, with endless replayability through evolving strategies and powerful relic combinations. Engage in turn-based combat that requires careful planning and resource management as you adapt to an ever-changing world of danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/StoreGif3.gif?t=1743210116\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3159440?t=1743210116","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743210116","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/2f9f0a0c6069d90147bbf8ac7b067cc9f369d394/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743210116","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/2f9f0a0c6069d90147bbf8ac7b067cc9f369d394/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743210116","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence and Use of Alcohol."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/StoreGif2.gif?t=1743210116\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into Cultivation Story: Infinite Sword Realm, a roguelike deckbuilder where every decision impacts your journey. Build a powerful deck from a variety of unique cards, collect relics, and unlock special perks that can shift the odds in your favor. Explore branching paths filled with challenging enemies, random encounters, and valuable treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/StoreGif1.gif?t=1743210116\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run brings fresh challenges, with endless replayability through evolving strategies and powerful relic combinations. Engage in turn-based combat that requires careful planning and resource management as you adapt to an ever-changing world of danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/StoreGif3.gif?t=1743210116\" /></p>","developers":["Bid Pond Studio Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/header.jpg?t=1743210116","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257095803,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095803/movie480.mp4?t=1738991022","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095803/movie_max.mp4?t=1738991022"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257095803/23e5fe